# Linux libfuse orphan files synced in from a remote peer
# (sshfs/encfs/Docker bind-mount holds a file open while another
# process replaces it -> libfuse renames it to .fuse_hiddenNNNN ->
# Syncthing replicates it back to this Mac, where R CMD check would
# otherwise trip on R/ containing invalid filenames).
.fuse_hidden*

